[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
title = "Natives"
brief_tooltip = "[Coming Soon]
Discover Inuit camps to trade.
Western goods for cold gear and food."
implemented = false
detailed_text = "[b]The Inuit — Coming Soon[/b]

[i]Inuit families encountered Franklin's men on several occasions and offered food and aid. Their testimony, passed down through generations, was crucial to piecing together what happened to the expedition.[/i]

Inuit communities on King William Island may become invaluable allies — if you can find them and earn their trust.

• Discover Inuit camps on the island
• Trade Western goods (tools, cloth, metal) for superior arctic gear and food
• Inuit clothing and food are far better than anything you can salvage from the ship
• How you treat them affects their willingness to trade

Finding and befriending the Inuit dramatically improves your odds of survival."
